[(Note also that [mtof] and [ftom] work fine)]
[(for microtones \050non-integral "MIDI pitch"\051)]
[(and don't have MIDI's range restriction -)]
[(for example, MIDI -36 is about 1 Hz.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
