0 30 632 [
[(Frequency refers to the number of cycles per second \050Hz\051. Pitch is)]
[("MIDI" Pitch, where "60" correspond to Middle C, 61 for C sharp, 72)]
[(for the next C up, and so on. The [osc~] object expects signals or)]
[(floating-point messages to set its frequency in Hz. You can, however,)]
[(set a "MIDI" Pitch value and convert to Frequency. Frequency and pitch)]
[(are converted using the [ftom] and [mtof] objects.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
